{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41505","headline":"怀连上旧居 · 孟宾于","name":"怀连上旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲思连上景难齐，树绕仙乡路绕溪。\n明月夜舟渔父唱，春风平野鹧鸪啼。\n城边寄信归云外，花下倾杯到日西。\n更忆海阳垂钓侣，昔年相遇草萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟宾于","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}